 <footer>
      <div class="foot">
        <div>
          <img src="images/hath.jpeg" alt="hands" height="130px" width="210px" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Together, we can make a difference.</h3>
          <p>
            Help bring happiness back to <br>those who've lost something important
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="contact">
          <button><a href="/about" style="text-decoration: none; color:white;">Contact Us</a>
             <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
